# Normalise line endings so a Windows checkout does not show every file
# as modified. Without this, `git status` on Windows listed 45 files with
# 9132 insertions and 9132 deletions that were pure CRLF noise —
# `git diff --ignore-all-space` was empty.
* text=auto

# Binary assets must never be normalised.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pt binary
*.pth binary
*.tif binary
*.tiff binary
*.czi binary
*.dcm binary
